# A byproduct of running the promote E2E by hand. No script regenerates it, and committing an artifact
# nothing can reproduce is the drift class the rest of this repository spends its gates preventing.
.acceptance/

# `golden-e2e.mjs` renders each category into `mkdtempSync(join(BUNDLE, ...))`, so it is inside the tree and
# shows up in `git status` as untracked while it runs. The script removes it in a `finally`, which covers
# every failure it can catch and none it cannot: `SIGINT` and `SIGKILL` skip `finally` entirely, so an
# interrupted run leaves a full rendered bundle behind. Ignored rather than relocated because the render has
# to sit under `bundle/` for `node_modules` to resolve, which is what the typecheck rung depends on.
.golden-*
